"This research facility on Moon Thegund was Joe's lab for about sixteen years."
"There Joe worked at 'containing demonic energies for certain wealthy benefactors'."
"Artonan authorities confiscated the lab and sold it to the Yipalck Corporation."
"It sits in a huge depression, ringed by a reflective perimeter building with a narrow door."
"The perimeter building has hotel-like residential halls, mudrooms and a common room with toys."
"Ten to twenty buildings are inside, among them greenhouse domes and two gray pentagon dishes."
"An underground ramp serves as its exit."
"It is in a high chaos area, which Thegund's System warns ranks below B not to approach."
"Yipalck evacuated only its own employees by ship; Joe's loyalists were told to stay."
"Thenn-ar led the loyalists who stayed, and Alden evacuated them one a night."
"Joe sent bombs to 'strategically tidy' the lab so Yipalck couldn't take his work."
"The lab is Joe's house on Thegund, east of Elepta, about a third of the way out of the red zone."
"Far fewer demon bugs reach the lab's crater than the land around it."
"Its exterior doors are about a hundred yards apart, unlocked, and open onto unharmed mudrooms."
"The main lab building may be magically booby-trapped; Alden taped a safe winding path through it."
"A huge vault in the main lab, likely a cage for dangerous summons, has white metal walls."
"The vault's floor is coated in runes that vaporize a demon instantly."
"The vault's six-foot-thick door opens only from outside, so Alden wedged it open with pipes."
"No demon bug has punched through the vault; Alden and Kibby sleep there."
"The perimeter building holds residential rooms and a rec room with kitchen, larder and big TV."
"The larder holds sacks of grain and beans and pre-packed meals in gold foil pouches."
"One greenhouse grows food hydroponically under artificial light; others hold hazmat suits."
"Chaos mutated the greenhouse plants, including giant heads Alden calls Thunder Lettuce."
"A thorny purple vine broke out of Hazmat Greenhouse Three and crept across the compound."
"The flat lab roof is the only place to see the land, as the lab has no windows."
"Tall lightposts, pale gray gravel and little sheds fill the grounds between buildings."
"The perimeter building's curved shiny walls are of non-native material, not 'ground'."
"Joe's old rooms hold his clothes, magic ink and brushes."
"Alden and Kibby painted a roof message: 'People living here. We politely request assistance.'"
"Alden and Kibby survived there alone for months after the System failed on Thegund."
"A plain metal garage off the underground ramp housed Joe's armored car."
"Kibby blew up the lab with Joe's bomb, leaving a crater, before she and Alden fled by car."
